From: HIRO15254 <60770863+HIRO15254@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:52:48 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] proto(p1): predictive DCFR+ (PDCFR+) behind SOLVERS_P1_PDCFR

Measurement-only prototype, not for merging. With SOLVERS_P1_PDCFR set
to "alpha,gamma" and f32 storage, solve and p1_bench use a third f32
arena for the last instantaneous regret: sigma_t is proportional to
max(0, w_t R + m), R becomes max(0, w_t R + r_t) and m becomes r_t.
Unset, outputs are bit-identical to 782bb6a.

Result: slower than DCFR to 0.1% pot (Turn 1760 vs 730 iterations,
3-bet-pot Flop 460 vs 210), so it is rejected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
